# Xcode
.DS_Store
build/
*.pbxuser
!default.pbxuser
*.mode1v3
!default.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
!default.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
!default.perspectivev3

# Local Xcode configuration files
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdata
*.xcconfig

# Personal release configuration (contains Apple Team ID)
ExportOptions.plist

# Pods
Pods/

# Fastlane
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output

# Benchmark results
benchmark-results/

# Environment files
.env
GoogleService-Info.plist

# SPM build artifacts and fetched packages
Packages/*/.build/
Packages/AnyLanguageModel/
Packages/*/Package.resolved

# Scratch / temp files
tmp/
*.bak

# App Store screenshot capture output
screenshots/
# Session/tool-local state (never ship)
.claude/
.grok/
# ignored: Obsidian vaults (tool artifact; no leading path so it matches at any depth)
.obsidian/

# Local build/deploy artifacts — xcarchives, capture pipelines, signing plists
# (contains personal team/device identifiers)
design-captures/

# Generated by running the in-app self-verify script
teemoon_verify.py
__pycache__/

# LiteRT-LM iOS xcframework is fetched by SPM from Google's GitHub Releases,
# never committed. The repackaged macOS xcframework IS committed, via Git LFS
# (see .gitattributes and Packages/LiteRTLM/VENDORING.md).

# sourcekit-lsp build settings for the .xcodeproj (xcode-build-server).
# Machine-specific: pins an absolute DerivedData path, and each git worktree
# needs its own. Regenerate with:
#   xcode-build-server config -project teemoon.xcodeproj -scheme teemoon
buildServer.json
.compile
